+# F-28: Tend UI Download Action
+
+## Result
+
+The download toolbar action now renders through:
+
+```text
+src/integrations/tend-ui/download-button.jsx
+```
+
+The adapter uses Tend UI `Button` and `Download`. It intentionally contains no click handler because the current product specification defines the action as a visible no-op prototype control.
+
+## Preserved Product Contract
+
+- stable id: `#js-download-btn`;
+- hidden in card view;
+- visible as `40 x 40` in table view;
+- accessible name and title: `Скачать`;
+- click does not change URL, drawers, toast or view state;
+- hidden in custom-group card view;
+- visible in the custom-group header in table view;
+- returns to the main toolbar when navigation leaves the custom group.
+
+## Ownership Boundary
+
+Vanilla `initViewSwitcher()` remains the owner of card/table visibility. `tasks-view.js` moves `#tend-ui-download-root` and uses the shared direct-child mount anchor on return.
+
+The adapter verifier explicitly rejects `onClick`, `fetch`, `location`, download attributes and toast calls inside this adapter. Real export/download mechanics must be introduced as a separate product task with an explicit data/file contract.
